{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Abram dwelt in the land of Canaan.</b> Even though Sodom and its sister cities are within Canaanite territory, the inhabitants of the land were nevertheless not Canaanites. If so, the verse states that Abram chose to dwell in that portion of the land inhabited by the children of Canaan, who were not so wicked as the people of Sodom, and he did not approach the border of Sodom at all."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:29:59.856163320Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}